  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      182.13,
      203.09,
      381.56,
      226.79
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE SRI LANKA BAPTIST SANGAMAYA(INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 54 OF 1944",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      240.05,
      401.89,
      312.83
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the members of the Sri Lanka Baptist Sangamayaformally known as Ceylon Baptist Council incorporatedunder Ceylon Baptist Council Ordinance No. 54 of 1944 asamended by the Sri Lanka Baptist Sangamaya (Incorporation)(Amendment) Act, No. 14 of 1991 have passed a resolutionto amend the name of the Sangamaya:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      326.09,
      401.86,
      374.39
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Sangamaya, for the purpose ofgiving effect to such resolution has applied to change thename of such Sangamaya and it will be expedient to grantsuch application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      387.65,
      401.88,
      411.23
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE, be it enacted by the Parliament of theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.49,
      401.89,
      448.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka BaptistSangamaya (Incorporation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2022.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      461.45,
      401.89,
      571.19
    ],
    "text": "2.In every context in which the Sri Lanka BaptistSangamaya is mentioned (whether by that name or by theabbreviation of \u201cthe Sangamaya\u201d) in the Sri Lanka BaptistSangamaya Act, No. 14 of 1991 (Incorporation) (Amendment)or in any notice or other document issued under that Act,there shall, unless the context otherwise requires, besubstituted for the expressions \u201cthe Sri Lanka BaptistSangamaya\u201d or \u201cthe Sangamaya\u201d, the expressions \u201cSri LankaBaptist Church or \u201cthe Church\u201d, as the case may be.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      584.45,
      401.91,
      669.59
    ],
    "text": "3.Every contract, agreement or other instrument ordocument whatsoever made, issued or executed prior to thedate of commencement of that Act, by or in favour \u201cthe SriLanka Baptist Sangamaya.\u201d shall be deemed on and after thedate of commencement of that Act to be and to have beenmade, issued or executed by or in favour of \u201cSri Lanka BaptistChurch\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
